        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.8,
            "end": 5.8,
            "text": "Quite a start on the year as a 2-6, 6-4, 6-2 win, and some words.\n逆转取胜，还附带一番口角"
          },
          {
            "at": 6.1,
            "end": 7.7,
            "text": "You don't say sorry, you think you're a good kid?\n你不道歉，还觉得自己是个好孩子？"
          },
          {
            "at": 8.4,
            "end": 10.2,
            "text": "Look at me. Hey, look at me, huh?\n看着我。喂，看着我！"
          },
          {
            "at": 10.8,
            "end": 12.2,
            "text": "You don't look at me.\n你都不敢看我。"
          },
          {
            "at": 12.9,
            "end": 17.6,
            "text": "He started it. He started it. Yes, he started it.\n是他先挑事的，是他先挑事的"
          },
          {
            "at": 17.9,
            "end": 19.5,
            "text": "He said, Russian, you think this is normal?\n他骂我「俄罗斯……」，这正常吗？"
          },
          {
            "at": 21.3,
            "end": 23.1,
            "text": "I answered him because he doesn't know how to fight.\n我回他，是因为他不懂怎么较量"
          },
          {
            "at": 23.8,
            "end": 25.2,
            "text": "He's a small kid who doesn't know how to fight.\n他就是个不懂怎么较量的小屁孩。"
          }
        ],
        "crosses_cut": true
      },
